  section 4 grilled G1-G7) -> 1.0.0 CRAN. Before CRAN: DESCRIPTION's
  Description: still says "Provides S4 classes". OPEN QUESTION for upstream:
  whether medfit's sandwich stacks the weight-model score (RRZ 1994).
  Manuscript runs on medsim, not missingmed.
