- 2026-10-07 (merged): PR #21 feature/ariv-fixed -> dev (13aa37c, squash),
  closes #19. infer(type = "mbco") gains ariv = c("fixed", "own"), default
  "fixed": each imputation's statistic is recomputed on the stacked fit's
  branch before forming r4 (ported from medsim 0.5.1). "own" is bit-identical
  to 0.4.0 and keeps the different-k refusal; "fixed" uses the stacked k with
  a design-rank guard. New exported mbco_d4(implist, ...) and S7 class
